  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>dx</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></math> are coprime natural numbers, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____ ."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "20",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Since,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>for</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>e</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p>"
  }
